       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SRCHALL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TBL.
          05 ENTRY OCCURS 5 TIMES
             ASCENDING KEY IS CODE-V INDEXED BY IDX.
             10 CODE-V PIC 99.
       01 WANT PIC 99 VALUE 30.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 10 TO CODE-V(1)
           MOVE 20 TO CODE-V(2)
           MOVE 30 TO CODE-V(3)
           MOVE 40 TO CODE-V(4)
           MOVE 50 TO CODE-V(5)
           SEARCH ALL ENTRY
               AT END DISPLAY "NOT FOUND"
               WHEN CODE-V(IDX) = WANT DISPLAY "FOUND AT " IDX
           END-SEARCH
           STOP RUN.
